==English==

===Etymology===
Possibly from [[Basque]] ''[[Jainko]]'', [[God]], used in a propaganda song.

===Pronunciation===
IPA: /ˈdʒɪŋgɘʊɪz(ɘ)m/

===Noun===
'''jingoism'''

# {{uncountable}} Excessive [[patriotism]] or [[aggressive]] [[nationalism]] esp. as regards foreign policy.

